WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.037
MEET. A goat, a child and a small green plant.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.421
ADD. Place water and air symbols near all living things.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:11.483
